; board-view.sabra — Midden-backed indexed board read (board v2).
;
; Queries `todo_by_created` (O(log N) indexed page of 24 items, optional
; filter like "state=open" or "") and `todo_counts` (retractable
; `(group state) (aggregate (count))` declarative projection), returning
; `(pair rows counts)` with exact whole-board open/done counts at any scale.
; `counts_limit` is passed as an input so the second prim call is bound
; under a lambda and never fires at compile time.

(lambda (filter)
  (lambda (cursor)
    (lambda (counts_limit)
      (pair
        (prim "midden/query" "todo_by_created" filter cursor "24")
        (prim "midden/query" "todo_counts" "" "" counts_limit)))))
